  "title": "Salted Caramel Chocolate Chip Cookies from Reynolds® Parchment Paper",
  "description": "A delightful twist on a family favorite. These cookies incorporate sweet caramel-filled chocolate candies, dark chocolate and a finishing sprinkle of sea salt for a fabulous sweet and salty combination.",
  "authors": [
    "Reynolds KitchensR"
  ],
